## GAP-001: SioOutcome Type Mismatch [CRITICAL]

**Location:** `brain/master/src/provider/candle.rs:93` vs `brain/master/src/outcome.rs:6`

**Error:** Runtime type mismatch causing compile failure.

**Details:**
```rust
// candle.rs:93 - Uses enum syntax
Ok(SioOutcome::Success {
    text: response.text,
    tokens: response.tokens,
})

// outcome.rs:6 - SioOutcome is a STRUCT, not enum
pub struct SioOutcome {
    pub status: String,
    pub result: Vec<u8>,
    pub answer: String,
    // ... other fields
}
```

**Impact:** Compile error - cannot use enum variant syntax on struct.

**Fix Required:**
```rust
// Option A: Convert to enum in outcome.rs
pub enum SioOutcome {
    Success { text: String, tokens: Vec<u32> },
    Error { message: String },
}

// Option B: Use struct syntax in candle.rs
Ok(SioOutcome {
    status: String::from("success"),
    result: response.tokens.iter().map(|&t| t as u8).collect(),
    answer: response.text,
    confidence: 0.0,
    reasoning_hash: String::new(),
    evidence: Vec::new(),
    recommendations: Vec::new(),
    commands: Vec::new(),
    telemetry: Telemetry::default(),
})
```

