## GAP-004: KV Cache Not Wired [MEDIUM]

**Location:** `brain/master/src/runtime/kv_cache.rs`

**Error:** KvCache struct exists but not integrated into inference chain.

**Details:**
- `KvCache` is created but never passed to transformer layers
- `Prefill` calls `infer()` without KV cache state
- Each inference pass recomputes all attention

**Impact:** 
- O(n²) attention complexity instead of O(n)
- Memory not reused across tokens

**Fix Required:**
```rust
// In inference engine:
pub struct BrainInferenceEngine {
    inference_engine: HacedleInferenceEngine,
    kv_cache: KvCache,  // Add KV cache
}

impl BrainInferenceEngine {
    pub fn infer_with_kv(&mut self, request: InferenceRequest) -> Result<InferenceResponse, &'static str> {
        // 1. Tokenize
        let tokens = self.inference_engine.tokenizer.encode(&request.prompt);
        
        // 2. Feed through layers with KV cache
        for layer in &mut self.inference_engine.transformer.layers {
            layer.forward_with_kv_cache(&embedded, &mut self.kv_cache);
        }
        
        // 3. Generate with cached keys/values
        // ...
    }
}
```

