## GAP-005: Coge Orphan Files Structure [MEDIUM]

**Location:** `brain/coge/`

**Error:** Rust library files at root level with no `src/lib.rs`.

**Current Structure:**
```
coge/
├── Cargo.toml
├── mod.rs        ← Root module (should be src/lib.rs)
├── infer.rs      ← Orphan file
├── lora.rs       ← Orphan file
├── run.rs        ← Orphan file
└── src/
    └── cat_dispatcher.rs
```

**Impact:** 
- `cargo build` fails for coge crate
- Unclear module structure

**Fix Required:**
```bash
# Move files to src/
mv coge/mod.rs coge/src/lib.rs
mv coge/infer.rs coge/src/infer.rs
mv coge/lora.rs coge/src/lora.rs
mv coge/run.rs coge/src/run.rs

# Update Cargo.toml
[lib]
name = "hace_brain_coge"
path = "src/lib.rs"
```

